---
description: Bun is the only package manager and script runner for this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

# Bun

- Install and add packages with `bun add` / `bun install`.
- Run scripts with `bun run` and one-off binaries with `bunx`.
- Prefer Bun APIs and tooling when scaffolding or configuring the app.
- Do not use npm, npx, yarn, or pnpm for this project.
